              "name": "cpp/misra/non-transient-lambda-implicitly-captures-this",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "RULE-8-1-1: A non-transient lambda shall not implicitly capture this"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Using implicit capture for a lambda declared in a class will capture the `this` pointer and not the instance members, which can be suprising and result in undefined behavior past the object's lifetime."
